Horde NPC Buy Items Q Warlock
    Events
        Time - Every 1.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        -------- Distance check for SHOP - Positions --------
        Set VariableSet NPC_VarPoint = (Position of NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock)
        Set VariableSet NPC_VarPoint2 = (Position of AI_Shop_Horde[1])
        Set VariableSet NPC_VarPoint3 = (Position of AI_Shop_Horde[2])
        Set VariableSet NPC_VarPoint4 = (Position of AI_Shop_Horde[3])
        Set VariableSet NPC_VarPoint5 = (Position of AI_Shop_Horde[4])
        -------- =================================== --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock is in Companion_Group.) Not equal to True
                NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockBuy Equal to True
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        (Distance between NPC_VarPoint and NPC_VarPoint2) Less than or equal to 250.00
                        (Distance between NPC_VarPoint and NPC_VarPoint3) Less than or equal to 250.00
                        (Distance between NPC_VarPoint and NPC_VarPoint4) Less than or equal to 250.00
                        (Distance between NPC_VarPoint and NPC_VarPoint5) Less than or equal to 250.00
            Then - Actions
                -------- =================================== --------
                Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
                -------- =================================== --------
                -------- AT THE SHOP --------
                -------- ITEM BOUGHT --------
                Set VariableSet NPC_Horde_AI_RogueBuy = False
                Set VariableSet NPC_VarPointShop = (Position of NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock)
                Item - Create NPC_ShopItem[(Random integer number between 1 and 9)] at NPC_VarPointShop
                Hero - Give (Last created item) to NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_VarPointShop)
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: (Warlock + (MAIN STATE -  + item(s) bought))
            Else - Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        -------- Distance check for SHOP OVER - Positions remove --------
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_VarPoint)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_VarPoint2)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_VarPoint3)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_VarPoint4)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_VarPoint5)
